{"questions":[{"question":"Kva er $\\ln(e^5)$?","options":["$5$","$e^5$","$1$","$e$"],"explanation":"$\\ln$ og $e^x$ er inverse funksjonar, så $\\ln(e^5) = 5$."},{"question":"Kva er $\\log_{10}(1000)$?","options":["$3$","$10$","$100$","$1000$"],"explanation":"$10^3 = 1000$, så $\\log_{10}(1000) = 3$."},{"question":"Kva logaritmeregel seier at $\\log(a \\cdot b) = \\log(a) + \\log(b)$?","options":["Produktregelen","Kvotientregelen","Potensregelen","Kjerneregelen"],"explanation":"Produktregelen for logaritmar seier at logaritmen av eit produkt er summen av logaritmane."},{"question":"Kva er definisjonsmengda til $f(x) = \\ln(x)$?","options":["$x > 0$","Alle reelle tal","$x \\geq 0$","$x \\geq 1$"],"explanation":"Logaritmen er berre definert for positive tal."},{"question":"Viss $\\ln(x) = 2$, kva er $x$?","options":["$e^2$","$2$","$\\ln(2)$","$2e$"],"explanation":"$\\ln(x) = 2$ tyder $x = e^2$."},{"question":"Forenkle $\\ln(x^3)$.","options":["$3\\ln(x)$","$\\ln(3x)$","$\\ln(x)^3$","$3 + \\ln(x)$"],"explanation":"Potensregelen: $\\ln(x^n) = n \\cdot \\ln(x)$, så $\\ln(x^3) = 3\\ln(x)$."},{"question":"Kva er $\\ln(1)$?","options":["$0$","$1$","$e$","Udefinert"],"explanation":"$\\ln(1) = 0$ fordi $e^0 = 1$."},{"question":"Forenkle $\\ln(a) - \\ln(b)$.","options":["$\\ln\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)$","$\\ln(a - b)$","$\\frac{\\ln(a)}{\\ln(b)}$","$\\ln(a) \\cdot \\ln(b)$"],"explanation":"Kvotientregelen: $\\ln(a) - \\ln(b) = \\ln\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)$."},{"question":"Løys likninga $\\log_2(x) = 5$.","options":["$x = 32$","$x = 10$","$x = 25$","$x = 5$"],"explanation":"$\\log_2(x) = 5$ tyder $x = 2^5 = 32$."},{"question":"Kva er $\\log_5(125)$?","options":["$3$","$5$","$25$","$\\frac{1}{3}$"],"explanation":"$125 = 5^3$, så $\\log_5(125) = 3$."},{"question":"Forenkle $\\log(100) + \\log(10)$ (titalslogaritme).","options":["$3$","$1000$","$110$","$2{,}5$"],"explanation":"$\\log(100) + \\log(10) = \\log(100 \\cdot 10) = \\log(1000) = 3$."},{"question":"Kva er $\\ln(e)$?"